# Composer development files
# Neither manifest is needed at runtime — the compiled autoloader in
# vendor/composer/ is self-contained — and the release workflow's "Verify
# distributable is clean" gate rejects both. The vendor/*/composer.json files
# that ship inside dependencies are part of those packages and stay put.
composer.json

